---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms — Veena's School of Indian Dances" description="Enrolment terms: fees, make-up classes, withdrawals and performance participation.">
  <PageHero title="Terms of Enrolment" lead="The short, fair version. Demo terms — replace with the client's final terms before launch." />
  <section class="px-4 py-12 sm:px-6"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-5 leading-relaxed text-ink/75">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Fees</h2><p>Term fees are due in Week 1 of each 10-week term. The annual registration fee is $35 per student. Discounts (sibling, multi-class, early-bird) are described on the Pricing page and applied at enrolment.</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Missed classes & withdrawals</h2><p>One make-up class per term in another batch at the same level, subject to space. Withdrawals need two weeks' written notice before the next term; mid-term withdrawals are credited, not refunded, except for medical reasons.</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Safety</h2><p>Students dance at their own pace under teacher supervision. Please tell us about injuries or medical conditions that affect participation. Children under 10 must be collected from inside the studio.</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Performances</h2><p>Participation in the annual recital (Taal) is included in enrolment; costume hire ($40–$60) and audience tickets are separate.</p>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
